{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24824","headline":"赋得玉水记方流 · 杜元颖","name":"赋得玉水记方流","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重泉生美玉，积水异常流。\n始玩清堪赏，因知宝可求。\n斗回虹气见，磬折紫光浮。\n中矩皆明德，同方叶至柔。\n月华偏共映，风暖伫将游。\n遇鉴终无暗，逢时愿见收。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜元颖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24824.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24824","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}